  "demoContent": "The Quiet Erosion — an investigation. For three months I requested the same ministry dataset; when it finally arrived, the totals on page four contradicted the summary the ministry published in March. The gap is not rounding: 1.4 billion pesos appears in one document and quietly vanishes in another. I am not an algorithm — I sat with these spreadsheets for weeks, called three sources who would only speak off the record, and walked the same corridors the budget describes. A machine can copy my words, but it cannot stand behind them. That is why this article carries a HumanVouch: a verified, unique person, anonymously, putting their reputation on the line — on-chain.",
